{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Below is a list of all Shop Schedules, including when they are open or closed."]],["p",["Note: All buildings and homes in Stardew Valley are \"locked\" on all ",["l","节日","festival"]," days where the festival begins before 7pm (i.e., all festivals other than ",["l","万灵节","Spirit's Eve"]," and ",["l","月光水母起舞","Dance of the Moonlight Jellies"],"). ",["l","下水道","The Sewers"],", ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],", ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"],", and the ",["l","温泉","Spa"]," will remain open. Shops and homes remain locked all day, even if the player does not attend the festival."]],["p",["The ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]," festival is unique, in that no homes or shops are locked during festival days (",["l","冬季","Winter"]," 15-17)."]],["p",["Obtaining the ",["l","小镇钥匙","Key To The Town"]," expands access to shops, but (despite its description) it has some restrictions."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Store Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Time Open"]},{"h":1,"v":["Shop times with\n",["f","Key_To_The_Town.png",28]," Key to the Town"]},{"h":1,"v":["Regular Days Off"]},{"h":1,"v":["Closure due to Festivals"]},{"h":1,"v":["Closure due to Check-up"]},{"h":1,"v":["Additional Notes"]}],[[["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"]],["2pm - 2am"],["6am - 2am"],["None"],["All"],["None"],[]],[[["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]],["9am - 4pm"],["6am - 7pm"],["Friday after ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"]," is restored"],["All"],["Winter 16 (",["l","克林特","Clint"],")"],[]],[[["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]],["9am - 5pm"],["8:20am - 5pm"],["Tuesday"],["All"],["Summer 18 (",["l","罗宾","Robin"],")"],["Closed when Robin working on your farm.\nCloses at 4pm on ",["l","周循环#Friday","Fridays"],"."]],[[["l","鱼店","Fish Shop"]],["9am - 5pm"],["no change (boat can be accessed\nat any time)"],["Saturday (only if not raining)"],["All"],["Spring 9 (",["l","威利","Willy"],")"],["Spring 9: Can shop from 9am-10am before Willy leaves for his check-up.\n Shop doors open at 8 after Boat to Ginger Island is repaired, thoug